--------------------
---- WORKSPACES ----
--------------------

-- Row 1 of the macbook spacework grid. Persistent so the prev/next cycling
-- (Super+, / Super+.) always walks the whole row, occupied or not.
-- Deliberately unnamed: waybar's format-icons carry the display names and
-- match by the numeric workspace name.
for i = 1, 9 do
    hl.workspace_rule({ workspace = tostring(i), persistent = true })
end
